    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An ideal purchase for first time buyers or investors! A fantastic opportunity to purchase this dream family home, in the village of Dunshaughlin.  This beautiful 104 sqm 3-bedroom Semi detached home the property presented in excellent condition, Accommodation enjoys well-proportioned rooms. This four-year-old home is ideally located on the Drumree road just outside Dunshaughlin, giving easy access to connecting roads. All amenities are within easy access, including schools, supermarkets, pubs, restaurants and sports facilities, bus stops and an hourly bus directly to the airport. \r\nViewing is highly recommended.\r\nContact John Bannon 086 8320042"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall \t3.0 x 5.3\t \r\nWooden floor. Alarm, rad covers and guest w.c. \r\nKitchen/Dining/    5.6 x 2.5\r\nWood floor. Kitchen floor & wall units, wonderfully new open-plan kitchen/ dining room stylishly finished with featuring double doors leading to a large back garden.\r\nSitting Room\t7.8 x 4.5\t\r\nWood floor. Large living room, double door to rear back garden.\t\r\nGuest WC\t1.4 x 1.3\t\r\nWood floor & wood panelling on wall– w.c. & w.h.b.\t \t\t\r\nBedroom 1\t\t4.8 x 2.7\r\nCarpet floors\r\nGenerous built-in wardrobes and blinds.\t\t\t\r\nEn-suite 2.1 x 1.7\t\r\nFully tiled. \r\nMains shower.\t\t\t\r\nBedroom 2 \t2.8 x 2.3\r\nCarpet floors\r\nLarge built-in wardrobes.\t\t\t\r\nBedroom 3\t\t3.8 x 2.7\r\nCarpet floors. \r\nFamily Bathroom\t 2.7 x 2.2\r\nTiled floor and around bath.\r\nFull Bath with shower, heated towel rails, whb and wc.\r\nGardens\t\t\r\nLarge back garden with raised flower beds.\r\nHigh boundary walls. \r\nServices\tGas boiler for central heating. \r\nMains water and sewerage.\r\nIncluded \tAll blinds, light fittings. Integrated kitchen appliances. \r\nBer Cert A3 No 112307426"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Large site.104 Sqm home.\r\nContemporary custom fitted kitchen units. \r\nFacing a green field & not over looked to the rear.\r\nWater softener installed.\r\nAmple parking.\r\nCul de sac location.\r\nUPVC windows.\r\nSmoke, Heat and Fire Alarms fitted\r\nPVC facia & soffit. \r\nA3 Ber cert.\r\nSolar Panels on the roof, provide substantial energy savings.\r\nLow management fee.(est 250)"
      },
